WEBVTT

00:10:29.600 --> 00:10:31.926
but I felt really refreshed,

00:10:31.950 --> 00:10:37.116
and like I had a new,
kind of, purpose and drive,

00:10:37.140 --> 00:10:42.121
and I found that I actually
was a happier person.

00:10:42.145 --> 00:10:45.326
AG: It almost sounds
like it gave you a sense of hope.

00:10:45.350 --> 00:10:47.696
CC: I think it probably did.

00:10:47.720 --> 00:10:52.746
And I think that really
was a turning point for me.

00:10:52.770 --> 00:10:53.937
I ended up committing

00:10:53.961 --> 00:10:57.080
and staying a couple years
longer in Philadelphia.

00:10:57.104 --> 00:10:58.416
(Music)

00:10:58.440 --> 00:11:02.116
AG: Your antidote to burnout
is not necessarily less work.